6. API Versioning
API versioning helps maintain old API clients while introducing new features.

Example:
/api/v1/users
/api/v2/users


Express example:
app.get("/api/v1/users", (req, res) => {
  res.json({
    version: "v1",
    message: "User API version 1"
  });
});

app.get("/api/v2/users", (req, res) => {
  res.json({
    version: "v2",
    message: "User API version 2"
  });
});


Interview point: API versioning prevents new changes from unexpectedly breaking existing applications.
